node_modules/
.DS_Store
# Duplicates that file-sync clients such as iCloud create: "README 2.md",
# "daily-review 3.sh", "skills 12". One or two digits after a space, with or
# without an extension.
* [0-9]
* [0-9][0-9]
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9].*
# Claude Desktop bundles (arena.mcpb) are about 5 MB and this folder is the
# Claude plugin, where every file must be under 5 MiB. Host a bundle as a
# release attachment or on arena-predictions.com, never in the repo.
*.mcpb
